      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Oh, hello there, sonny. I'm just tidying up while my wife works at our
        Air B&B next door.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: I COULD have her do the work, but she already works so hard, and it
        really isn't fair.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Plus, every good person knows that women should be respected just as
        much as men.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'I never understood all of that hoopla, but if there''s one thing that
        the younger generation has done right, it''s this:'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Everyone is much more accepting of other people's differences now than
        back when I was your age.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
